        "TileImage": "$($repository cee4e428-1efb-42ef-8eb5-763822781738).Image",
        "Description": "Aruna Narain and Rutherford have booked a spa and dinner meeeting wich i frankly am pretty jelous about, but none the less, at the meeting they will exchange information about the client that might ruin his carrier and you need to  &apos;&apos;take care of them&apos;&apos; before the meeting wich, by the way starts at seven pm. So, hurry up 47 and most of all, good luck!\r\rPS. I heard that Narain likes to ride a water scooter and i would recomend bringing explosives to create an unfortunate accident.\r\rMr.S",
